99
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:10,400
It's incredible.

100
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,160
Are we that different?

101
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,200
As long as I don't set you off,

102
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:18,000
