103
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,120
So you're no Night Owl.

104
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,240
You're a late-night snack at best.

105
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,080
You eat steak for a late-night snack?

106
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,200
