115
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:20,480
Yongsen.

116
00:10:21,280 --> 00:10:22,000
Zhang Yongsen.

117
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:24,600
Same name, huh?

118
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:25,800
How original.

119
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:29,560
So you

120
