No.

193
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:50,800
You're sick.

194
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:52,720
No, no, no.

195
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,480
You're clearly the sick one,

196
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,320
Zhang Yongsen.

197
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,080
You're going to get sick.

198
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:00,400
And only when you're in love with me
can the drug...

199
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:02,760
I can't say it yet.

200
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:04,760
That rule doesn't exist

201
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:05,400
