202
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:06,760
If I say it, I'll have to start over.

203
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,320
Love's just a fairy tale.

204
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:12,400
For grown-ups,

205
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:14,400
