206
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:17,160
not a story.

207
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,160
And there's the disaster.

208
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:34,800
I knew I'd never get

209
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:37,000
