218
00:16:18,580 --> 00:16:23,200
♪In another universe,
things might be different♪

219
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:29,120
♪But your name♪

220
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:30,400
I don't know what love is.

221
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,040
But I do know

222
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,400
