236
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:11,560
Play along!

237
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:13,240
Playing along.

238
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:17,720
Then you find out

239
00:17:18,840 --> 00:17:20,720
I lead a double life

240
00:17:21,320 --> 00:17:24,400
