246
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,520
(They're the same person,)

247
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,400
(and they're not.)

248
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:03,228
♪Does fate write every hello♪

249
00:18:03,233 --> 00:18:05,457
