252
00:18:22,543 --> 00:18:23,703
♪I remember♪

253
00:18:24,783 --> 00:18:26,943
♪The way you breathe♪

254
00:18:28,423 --> 00:18:30,983
♪Countless versions of me♪

255
00:18:32,103 --> 00:18:33,823
♪All point♪

256
00:18:34,903 --> 00:18:37,823
♪In the same direction♪

257
00:18:38,263 --> 00:18:41,863
♪Toward you♪

258
00:18:43,503 --> 00:18:45,303
♪I'll find you♪

259
00:18:45,303 --> 00:18:47,903
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

260
